# Rank 2 Mission (battlefield.rank_2_mission) with a Windurst char. A level 75 Warrior of Windurst with The Three
# Kingdoms completed and no mission current, plus bob (Windurst) and sando (San d'Oria, Journey to Windurst (the
# second) current at status 8 and the Dark Key). Alone, BC_Entrance plays NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY (7251). sando invites
# the main char and bob; sando registers area 3 (option 3); the main char, whose nation's rank 2 is completed, enters
# it as a non-registrant; bob triggers and is refused (the entry already closed). The main char's Burning_Circle+2
# plays 32003; its finish with option 4 leaves. sando's pair of arena 3 killed: the timer, WON, 32001; sando finished:
# status 9 and the Kindred Crest.
lists BalgasDais/BC_Entrance/onTrigger BalgasDais/BC_Entrance/onTrade BalgasDais/onEventUpdate/32000 BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32000 BalgasDais/Burning_Circle/onTrigger BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32003 BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=BalgasDais pos=300.4,-124.1,341.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=2
char bob zone=BalgasDais pos=300.4,-124.1,341.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=2
char sando zone=BalgasDais pos=300.4,-124.1,341.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Windurst TheThreeKingdoms completed
sando: mission Sandoria JourneyToWindurst2 current
sando: keyitem DarkKey
login
trigger BC_Entrance
bob: login
sando: login
sando: missionstatus Sandoria 8
sando: invite main
accept
sando: invite bob
bob: accept
sando: trigger BC_Entrance
sando: update 32000 option=3
sando: finish
trigger BC_Entrance
update 32000 option=3
finish
bob: trigger BC_Entrance
trigger Burning_Circle+2
finish option=4
tick 2000
sando: kill #17375237
sando: kill #17375238
